		{
			dependencies: ["504F53000000100A"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0101: Posting]"
				""
				"Welcome to River Crossing: a handful of survivors and the first machines NCP ever let them keep."
				"Your goal here is &bClearance Level 1&r: prove you can run a small, automated factory."
				"&7Steam is allowed but never required. Everything here runs on ULV electricity."
				"&7Enclosed: two sugar cane. Plant them next to the spring: paper is everywhere in GregTech."
			]
			id: "398DA3318FB70483"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 2
					id: "623745498615BEEC"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
