			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0115: Blast Furnace]"
				""
				"Redstone hides deeper than any iron hammer reaches, and every circuit needs it. You need &bsteel&r first."
				"The &bPrimitive Blast Furnace&r makes it from iron and coal, no power needed."
				"&aFirebricks:&r mortar clay into clay dust and bricks into brick dust; mix them into fireclay dust;"
				"pack it into compressed fireclay (by hand); fire it in a furnace. Four firebrick make a firebricks block."
				"&7Check the multiblock shape in EMI. Slow, hot, and worth it."
			]
			id: "CFE81DB356FFC332"
