		{
			dependencies: ["BD916EB4DA72382D"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0111: Rubber]"
				""
				"No rubber trees, no resin; no resin, no rubber trees. Positronic Memory breaks the loop:"
				"rubber is isoprene, C5H8. On a crafting table, &b5 carbon + 4 hydrogen (H2)&r in a checkerboard make two &bsticky resin&r."
				"Eight resin earn two rubber saplings, and from then on the trees do the work. Resin insulates wire and makes circuit boards."
			]
			id: "D17A59BE9671EB7D"
			rewards: [
