		}
		{
			dependencies: ["CFDF70CCAFE922AC"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0112: Memory]"
				""
				"Your first ingot. Now meet the &bTransmutation Tablet&r: four iron, four glass and your NCP Scrip as a login."
				"It reads and writes &bPositronic Memory&r (EMC). Memory only understands &bchemical elements&r: an iron ingot means"
				"nothing to it, but sixteen &biron atoms&r (ChemLib) do. Burn an element into the tablet to learn it; spend EMC to make more."
				"Later, the &bDissolver&r (LV) turns your production into elements, and a GregTech compressor packs 16 elements"
				"back into one dust, one tier after the metal is first needed. The planets still have to be done by hand."
				"&7Enclosed: 20 carbon and 16 hydrogen atoms. Burn one of each to learn them; the rest is your first rubber (see Rubber)."
			]
			id: "BD916EB4DA72382D"
			rewards: [
				{
